Date: Tue, 3 Mar 2026 13:28:27 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 120/913] dts: stm32: add reserved memory for stm32mp215f-dk

Add file stm32mp215f-dk-ca35tdcid-resmem.dtsi with the memory mapping
used for on the stm32mp215f-dk.
Also update the dile stm32mp215f-dk-ca35tdcid-rif.dtsi with the RIF
configuration for the memory regions.

